><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mrow><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c394\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi data-mjx-variant=\"-tex-calligraphic\" mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi></mrow><mo>\u2248</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">[</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>\u2026</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi><mo>\u2212</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">]</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">\u0394</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"134\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the number of